# Explicit submission path budget (total hard limit: 8,388,608 bytes):
# src/, tests/, root source/config/docs: <= 524,288 bytes
# public/: <= 131,072 bytes
# dist/: <= 524,288 bytes (required export, included below)
# artifacts/: <= 6,291,456 bytes (required screenshots/review/licenses)
# Remaining 917,504 bytes reserved for Git packaging overhead.
# Dependency, cache and scratch directories have a zero submission budget.
**/node_modules/
**/.vite/
**/.npm/
**/.cache/
**/coverage/
/test/scratch/
/.playwright-mcp/

# Override the worker's artifact exclusion only for the deliverable directory.
!/dist/
!/dist/**
!/artifacts/
!/artifacts/**
